            {
              "id": "d1",
              "name": "task",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "=You are being asked to DIAGNOSE a failed n8n workflow execution. Do NOT make any changes — do NOT create, update, publish, or modify any workflow. Only inspect, diagnose the root cause, and suggest a concrete fix in your reply.\n\nFailure details:\n- Workflow name: {{ $json.workflowData?.name || $json.name || 'unknown' }}\n- Workflow ID: {{ $json.workflowId }}\n- Execution ID: {{ $json.id }}\n- Execution URL: {{ $vars.instance_url }}workflow/{{ $json.workflowId }}/executions/{{ $json.id }}\n- Error message: {{ $json.data?.resultData?.error?.message || 'n/a' }}\n- Failed node: {{ $json.data?.resultData?.lastNodeExecuted || 'n/a' }}\n- Error stack / details: {{ $json.data?.resultData?.error?.stack || $json.data?.resultData?.error?.description || 'n/a' }}\n\nPlease use the n8n MCP tools to inspect workflow {{ $json.workflowId }}, identify the root cause of this failure, and describe a specific suggested fix. Remember: DIAGNOSE ONLY — do not apply any changes."
